(6902414, 1039938, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Except for that very hot spot on the one curve, it''s just about perfect.  I''m wondering why you didn''t replace that in Expert?  Top ten for sure.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Love this.  Except for that very hot spot on the one curve, it''s just about perfect.  I''m wondering why you didn''t replace that in Expert?  Top ten for sure.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902415, 1039967, 138630, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful - this has a magic quality for me and its simplicity is very appealing.  Love the shadow - double the windows, double the pleasure.  Great tones, too.</td>', 'Just beautiful - this has a magic quality for me and its simplicity is very appealing.  Love the shadow - double the windows, double the pleasure.  Great tones, too.', '2012-11-08 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902416, 1039124, 138630, '<td valign="top">What a very charming scene - processed to look like a painting which is perfect for it.  I have loved exploring the details and I love the framing and the way I''m invited into the scene.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.</td>', 'What a very charming scene - processed to look like a painting which is perfect for it.  I have loved exploring the details and I love the framing and the way I''m invited into the scene.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902417, 1039918, 138630, '<td valign="top">This does not feel like Expert editing (ie a composite) so if it is, I applaud you for your skill in creating a most natural and fascinating scene.  I have a very real sense of the life of this kitchen worker and the reality of the environment.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.</td>', 'This does not feel like Expert editing (ie a composite) so if it is, I applaud you for your skill in creating a most natural and fascinating scene.  I have a very real sense of the life of this kitchen worker and the reality of the environment.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902418, 1039507, 138630, '<td valign="top">I hope someone gets home soon.  Composition, tones and soft processing are all lovely as is the expression.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.</td>', 'I hope someone gets home soon.  Composition, tones and soft processing are all lovely as is the expression.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902419, 1039980, 138630, '<td valign="top">Maybe she''s waving a wand - maybe she doesn''t need one.  I find this dance of the windows both fanciful and enchanting.  Lovely light and colors.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.</td>', 'Maybe she''s waving a wand - maybe she doesn''t need one.  I find this dance of the windows both fanciful and enchanting.  Lovely light and colors.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902420, 1039335, 138630, '<td valign="top">This could so easily be too busy - maybe it is for some but I love exploring the many layers here.  Terrific shot.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.</td>', 'This could so easily be too busy - maybe it is for some but I love exploring the many layers here.  Terrific shot.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902421, 1039907, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nicely conceived, visualized, created.  Love that merge on the glass of water and the tropical cocktail!  So many nice touches and the tones are used very effectively.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.</td>', 'Nicely conceived, visualized, created.  Love that merge on the glass of water and the tropical cocktail!  So many nice touches and the tones are used very effectively.  Top ten for me - voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902423, 1039218, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great bridal shot and a very nice take on the challenge.  Not crazy about the eye makeup (I''m a less is better person), but unless this is a self portrait, I guess you couldn''t do much about that LOL  And as I look around me these days, I realize I''m quite in the minority anyway :)  Top ten for me - voted earlier.</td>', 'Great bridal shot and a very nice take on the challenge.  Not crazy about the eye makeup (I''m a less is better person), but unless this is a self portrait, I guess you couldn''t do much about that LOL  And as I look around me these days, I realize I''m quite in the minority anyway :)  Top ten for me - voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
