(6902433, 1039845, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice score as I love the repeated windows and all the different kids - some very nice poses.  I am not crazy about the poster edges or whatever you used in post processing. Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nice score as I love the repeated windows and all the different kids - some very nice poses.  I am not crazy about the poster edges or whatever you used in post processing. Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
