(6902435, 1039762, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and scene.  I think the framing needs to be perfectly vertical and horizontal in something like this and I would prefer to see the entire handle as you could not crop it off and have nearly as beautiful a scene.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lovely light and scene.  I think the framing needs to be perfectly vertical and horizontal in something like this and I would prefer to see the entire handle as you could not crop it off and have nearly as beautiful a scene.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902436, 1039944, 138630, '<td valign="top">Crazy.  I think you had way too much fun doing this one.  Love the suspenders.  Not so much the flames around the windows or the title :)   Voted earlier.</td>', 'Crazy.  I think you had way too much fun doing this one.  Love the suspenders.  Not so much the flames around the windows or the title :)   Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902438, 1039954, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I keep coming back so that is a good thing.  I don''t get it, though.  If I have an aha moment before roll-over, I''ll let you know :)  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I keep coming back so that is a good thing.  I don''t get it, though.  If I have an aha moment before roll-over, I''ll let you know :)  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902440, 1039937, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the graphics of the design the overall composition.  I think I would have taken a few more liberties with the color and maybe cloned that blue and white thing out since it''s Expert.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Love the graphics of the design the overall composition.  I think I would have taken a few more liberties with the color and maybe cloned that blue and white thing out since it''s Expert.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902441, 1039986, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the idea - a very nice frame, beautiful flowers, pretty little vases.  I might have put more distance between the window and the backdrop and tried to avoid the shadows and I for sure would have made use of the transform tools to get horizontals and verticals that were parallel to the edges.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Love the idea - a very nice frame, beautiful flowers, pretty little vases.  I might have put more distance between the window and the backdrop and tried to avoid the shadows and I for sure would have made use of the transform tools to get horizontals and verticals that were parallel to the edges.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 20:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
