(6902465, 1039335, 63218, '<td valign="top">The color unifies this really well, so that at first glance my mind accepts it without question. I enjoyed lingering to look around, discovering things. Maybe my fav is the knife on the counter. Or the skinny kids'' legs. Good work. This Flying Pig is for you--<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread was started in honor of those entries in Expert editing challenges that are outside the categories of traditional photography.<br/> <br/>Photo montage as I understand it, is a process of combining multiple photographs into one image that looks as realistic as a single original image.<br/> <br/>This wonderful composition uses the process of photo montage to combine many photo-realistic images &amp; the result is not at all realistic, but more like personal moments remembered all at once, in a single vision. It is unique to its creator &amp; experienced uniquely by each viewer.<br/> <br/>I like it.</td>', 'The color unifies this really well, so that at first glance my mind accepts it without question. I enjoyed lingering to look around, discovering things. Maybe my fav is the knife on the counter. Or the skinny kids'' legs. Good work. This Flying Pig is for you--   The Flying Pig thread was started in honor of those entries in Expert editing challenges that are outside the categories of traditional photography. Photo montage as I understand it, is a process of combining multiple photographs into one image that looks as realistic as a single original image. This wonderful composition uses the process of photo montage to combine many photo-realistic images & the result is not at all realistic, but more like personal moments remembered all at once, in a single vision. It is unique to its creator & experienced uniquely by each viewer. I like it.', '2012-11-08 21:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902475, 1039956, 63218, '<td valign="top">That fine periwinkle blue combined with the warm buttered-toast gold could keep me here for hours. Lucky for me, while I''m here I have a fine composition to gaze at. There is nothing more magical than a secret garden. I wish I could see this one--or maybe not. What <u>is</u> that black oven-like cavity? Is this the secret garden of a wicked witch?</td>', 'That fine periwinkle blue combined with the warm buttered-toast gold could keep me here for hours. Lucky for me, while I''m here I have a fine composition to gaze at. There is nothing more magical than a secret garden. I wish I could see this one--or maybe not. What is that black oven-like cavity? Is this the secret garden of a wicked witch?', '2012-11-08 21:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902487, 1039513, 138630, '<td valign="top">Lines are nice and I like the frame within a frame.  Lovely exposure and clarity on the scene outdoors.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Lines are nice and I like the frame within a frame.  Lovely exposure and clarity on the scene outdoors.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902488, 1039936, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice find with great texture, shapes, color.  I long for the transform work that would pull the left side into parallel with the edge of the frame and also for a bit of breathing space on the left.  The red shutters are a little over-exposed, I think.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Nice find with great texture, shapes, color.  I long for the transform work that would pull the left side into parallel with the edge of the frame and also for a bit of breathing space on the left.  The red shutters are a little over-exposed, I think.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902489, 1039213, 138630, '<td valign="top">Fascinating take and very nice illustration of this saying.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Fascinating take and very nice illustration of this saying.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902490, 1039150, 138630, '<td valign="top">Such fun to sort out and make sense of - though that really isn''t necessary as the nonsense is quite nice in its own right.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Such fun to sort out and make sense of - though that really isn''t necessary as the nonsense is quite nice in its own right.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902491, 1039975, 138630, '<td valign="top">I think I''m enjoying the reflection entries in this challenge more than I did those in the recent Reflection challenge :)  Maybe crop off the left just a tad to lose that half pole leaning into the frame . . . Voted earlier.</td>', 'I think I''m enjoying the reflection entries in this challenge more than I did those in the recent Reflection challenge :)  Maybe crop off the left just a tad to lose that half pole leaning into the frame . . . Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902492, 1039916, 138630, '<td valign="top">A most impressive window - looks like a great flat/apartment.  Not crazy about the soft processing - gives a muddy look to the panes and more darkness to the recesses than I would like, I think.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'A most impressive window - looks like a great flat/apartment.  Not crazy about the soft processing - gives a muddy look to the panes and more darkness to the recesses than I would like, I think.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902494, 1039985, 138630, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject - one I think you would have been better to shoot from more of a distance (though maybe the view to the inside wasn''t as nice . . . )  Because everything is cut off and kind of wonky, the image feels unfinished to me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Interesting subject - one I think you would have been better to shoot from more of a distance (though maybe the view to the inside wasn''t as nice . . . )  Because everything is cut off and kind of wonky, the image feels unfinished to me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902495, 1039923, 138630, '<td valign="top">Adore the sense of scale this waiting figure gives this shot.  How I wish there was more space at the top.  Given the Expert Editing rules, I might have cloned out the tree on the right and added a row of blocks - I think it could have been done convincingly.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Adore the sense of scale this waiting figure gives this shot.  How I wish there was more space at the top.  Given the Expert Editing rules, I might have cloned out the tree on the right and added a row of blocks - I think it could have been done convincingly.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6902499, 1039970, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great tower with many tiny windows - many are almost lost in the patterns of the blocks but it''s kind of fun to hunt for them.  Was this background switched out?  If it was, I think you could have found a better one; if it wasn''t, I think I would have done so.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Great tower with many tiny windows - many are almost lost in the patterns of the blocks but it''s kind of fun to hunt for them.  Was this background switched out?  If it was, I think you could have found a better one; if it wasn''t, I think I would have done so.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
