(6902510, 1039261, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the lines of this triangular buildint and the clarity and tones of your shot are very nice.  I''d have been tempted to crop above the red thing and lose the entire bottom.  I think the top of this building could have carried the entire image quite well.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'I love the lines of this triangular buildint and the clarity and tones of your shot are very nice.  I''d have been tempted to crop above the red thing and lose the entire bottom.  I think the top of this building could have carried the entire image quite well.  Voted earlier.', '2012-11-08 22:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
