(6902731, 1039621, 28742, '<td valign="top">Nice and serendipitous! Congrats on top ten, Spiffy. I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Nice and serendipitous! Congrats on top ten, Spiffy. I gave it a 10.', '2012-11-09 02:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902736, 1039124, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well I gave it a 9. My guess on why it finished where it did is the meeger connection to the challenge topic. Beautiful image and yeah, it has a window in it. In the right challenge, this is an easy ribbon. ...but I''m certain I haven''t said anything you don''t already know. :)</td>', 'Well I gave it a 9. My guess on why it finished where it did is the meeger connection to the challenge topic. Beautiful image and yeah, it has a window in it. In the right challenge, this is an easy ribbon. ...but I''m certain I haven''t said anything you don''t already know. :)', '2012-11-09 02:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902739, 1039155, 28742, '<td valign="top">Yeah, your scoring is all over the map as would be expected. Congrats on all the "unofficial" accolades, including the 9 from me. :)</td>', 'Yeah, your scoring is all over the map as would be expected. Congrats on all the "unofficial" accolades, including the 9 from me. :)', '2012-11-09 02:13:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902746, 1039261, 28742, '<td valign="top">I liked this a lot. Gave it an 8. Reading the comments, I think nam might be right about the crop.</td>', 'I liked this a lot. Gave it an 8. Reading the comments, I think nam might be right about the crop.', '2012-11-09 02:17:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902749, 1039980, 94134, '<td valign="top">Really disappointed in everyone....this shouldve been first!!! Such a great image :) Congrats on HM!</td>', 'Really disappointed in everyone....this shouldve been first!!! Such a great image :) Congrats on HM!', '2012-11-09 02:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902750, 1039519, 28742, '<td valign="top">I had a cold when voting and had a wad of kleenex in my hand and was looking for a trash can but there was none to be found and I gave this a 7. Woulda been an 8 if you didn''t clone out the trash can. :P &lt;kidding&gt; <br/> <br/>The border probably dragged this down a little. I like it, but that type of border puts many people off for some reason.</td>', 'I had a cold when voting and had a wad of kleenex in my hand and was looking for a trash can but there was none to be found and I gave this a 7. Woulda been an 8 if you didn''t clone out the trash can. :P <kidding>  The border probably dragged this down a little. I like it, but that type of border puts many people off for some reason.', '2012-11-09 02:20:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902753, 1039290, 28742, '<td valign="top">5.89 for a fairly simplistic image and basic in expert is not bad at all. I am certain there are plenty of photos that could be done in basic and compete in expert and win - this just wasn''t one of them. Solid entry in any case.</td>', '5.89 for a fairly simplistic image and basic in expert is not bad at all. I am certain there are plenty of photos that could be done in basic and compete in expert and win - this just wasn''t one of them. Solid entry in any case.', '2012-11-09 02:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902759, 1039944, 28742, '<td valign="top">Whoa - Minso - so, this was yours?? :P Be sure to post a thread asking what''s up with the 3 10''s. ;-)</td>', 'Whoa - Minso - so, this was yours?? :P Be sure to post a thread asking what''s up with the 3 10''s. ;-)', '2012-11-09 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6902762, 1039954, 109387, '<td valign="top">I was sure it was yours  :)<br/> <br/>It deserved a better position than this - it''s a very elegant image</td>', 'I was sure it was yours  :) It deserved a better position than this - it''s a very elegant image', '2012-11-09 02:27:57.000000', NULL, 0),
