(6903040, 1039967, 131871, '<td valign="top">I love kitties. :) Congrats! Glad you noticed what I mentioned though about the light (or lack thereof) on the floor. Whenever I do expert editing stuff, I really try to imagine what things would look like, lighting wise, if it were real, in order to make the most blended, realistic photo, despite the fact if it''s more fantasy or reality. Luckily you chose a very real image and not something fantasy-ish, so visualizing how the light would have reacted to the floor is easy. :) You just gotta remember to do it. Nice work either way!</td>', 'I love kitties. :) Congrats! Glad you noticed what I mentioned though about the light (or lack thereof) on the floor. Whenever I do expert editing stuff, I really try to imagine what things would look like, lighting wise, if it were real, in order to make the most blended, realistic photo, despite the fact if it''s more fantasy or reality. Luckily you chose a very real image and not something fantasy-ish, so visualizing how the light would have reacted to the floor is easy. :) You just gotta remember to do it. Nice work either way!', '2012-11-09 10:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
