(6903174, 1039954, 63218, '<td valign="top">I came back hoping for Photographer''s Comments -- thanks! I left my computer for a while &amp; walked into the room with this on the screen I noticed that a much more exciting window when viewed from across the room, &amp; I didn''t much notice the chair. It really is a shame we don''t at least have the option to ''click here'' to view a larger image while voting (or at any time). Congratulations on your top ten finish!</td>', 'I came back hoping for Photographer''s Comments -- thanks! I left my computer for a while & walked into the room with this on the screen I noticed that a much more exciting window when viewed from across the room, & I didn''t much notice the chair. It really is a shame we don''t at least have the option to ''click here'' to view a larger image while voting (or at any time). Congratulations on your top ten finish!', '2012-11-09 12:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
