(6903193, 1039507, 19825, '<td valign="top">Darn it, Anita. I had just edged ahead of you in the Unofficial Point &amp; Ribbon Race with my finish in the Windows challenge and you had to go and immediately get fourth to leap frog me in the standings. You are at 18th and I am in a three way tie for 19th three points behind you. I hope your business picks up so I have a chance to catch up.<br/> <br/>It is a lovely image, by the way -- beautiful mood and light. Nice job.</td>', 'Darn it, Anita. I had just edged ahead of you in the Unofficial Point & Ribbon Race with my finish in the Windows challenge and you had to go and immediately get fourth to leap frog me in the standings. You are at 18th and I am in a three way tie for 19th three points behind you. I hope your business picks up so I have a chance to catch up. It is a lovely image, by the way -- beautiful mood and light. Nice job.', '2012-11-09 12:59:20.000000', NULL, 0),
