(6905562, 1039155, 5112, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see this before.  Just now, because Posthumous posted it to a thread.  It is beautiful!  I am blown away.  I love it.<br/> <br/>Added:  I also love what you posted in the Flying Pig thread, about time and space and photography.  It is that kind of thinking that I would so love to do all the time, and it is from those spaces where I most want to make my photos, regardless of what''s correct or proper or whatever photography.  You are speaking beautiful words.  Thank you.<br/> <br/>Added #2:  And you are [indirectly?] encouraging me to go out and try new things, try to find that vision that is so elusive, and yet so real and so within my grasp and so far at the same time.  Man, I am all happy about trying more now!  Thanks again!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-11-14 00:12:12.</i></td>', 'I didn''t see this before.  Just now, because Posthumous posted it to a thread.  It is beautiful!  I am blown away.  I love it. Added:  I also love what you posted in the Flying Pig thread, about time and space and photography.  It is that kind of thinking that I would so love to do all the time, and it is from those spaces where I most want to make my photos, regardless of what''s correct or proper or whatever photography.  You are speaking beautiful words.  Thank you. Added #2:  And you are [indirectly?] encouraging me to go out and try new things, try to find that vision that is so elusive, and yet so real and so within my grasp and so far at the same time.  Man, I am all happy about trying more now!  Thanks again!', '2012-11-14 00:08:11.000000', '2012-11-14 00:12:12.000000', 0),
